help-syntax = 
    Search syntax (Everything compatible)
        space   AND        |   OR        !   NOT       < >   grouping       "…"   literal text
        {"*"}  ?    wildcards (whole name)   \ in a term matches the full path   ^abc / abc$ start / end of name
    Modifiers: case: ww: wfn: path: regex: diacritics: nopath: py: (pinyin) …
    Functions: ext:jpg;png  size:>10mb  dm:today  dc:2026  attrib:H  parent:C:\Windows  child:*.mp3  dupe:  empty:  depth:2 …
    Macros: audio: zip: doc: exe: pic: video:
    Commands: type /search_delay=100 or /reindex in the search box and press Enter.
